  "id": "wispae-protection-initiative",
  "name": "Wispae Protection Initiative",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Wispae_Protection_Initiative",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-25T08:56:07.867Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They are tiny lives born from condensed Wishpower. They are another form of continuation for the fallen imagenae in this world."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-00be6f014896cb2a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As you hurry through the streets and alleys, have you ever noticed those little wanderers, the"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "wispae"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6f39aae5c7a04307"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "These adorable and harmless little fellows, just like red blood cells, carry the city's \"oxygen,\""
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "wishes"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-10d71168e7351ee6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It is these seemingly insignificant \"wishes\" coming together that have forged the prosperous cityscape of Planarcadia."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7309e48af81839f2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Can you imagine what a city without wispae would look like?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b8f938474410443f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Without the wispae, how can artists rebuild and repair the city, or breathe new life into the imagenae?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-08979c7f588b1b7a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Without the wispae, how would the bank manage currency and turn Wishpower into circulating assets?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a350b609ef696f94"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The wispae is not just a cultural icon unique to Planarcadia, but also indispensable partners in our daily life and work."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0de238e823ac6122"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Protecting wispae starts with you and me!"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-07d426d3d82a4df9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fd0498e2522c8f32"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
